TITLE 1D transport with cation exchange

SOLUTION 1  Initial solution (to fill cells)
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 2-10
    pH 7.0
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 0  Infilling solution (inflow boundary)
    pH 7.0
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file sel.txt
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -molalities Ca+2

END
